B.m4=new A.aA("phone","Telephone Log","landing",0,"The operator's slip beside the attic telephone: \u201cOutgoing call, 10:50 PM \u2013 11:30 PM. Caller: Miss T. Misu. To: Madame Leine's Hat Boutique, after-hours line. Line never dropped.\u201d",B.mn,B.lI)
