B.DI=new A.aA("phone","Telephone Log","landing",0,"The operator's slip beside the attic telephone: \u201cOutgoing call, 10:50 PM \u2013 11:30 PM. Caller: Col. Cannoli. To: Fort Fondant Officers' Club. Line never dropped.\u201d",B.mn,B.lI)
